Decoding with LEACE erasure works with `tuning` and `calibration`: its projector needs no groups, so prediction no longer passes them (calibration failed on the unexpected `groups`). EA erasure (`ea_mean`, `ea_coral`) is refused with either, with the reason: it needs the test subjects' groups, which a search's inner scoring and calibration do not pass, and tuning scored NaN in every inner fold and kept the first candidate.
